{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "SingleR 会自动把分析限制在 ref 与 test 的基因交集上；如果交集为空（例如两者使用不同基因注释），会直接报错。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The function will automatically restrict the analysis to the intersection of the genes in both \\code{ref} and \\code{test}.\n#' If this intersection is empty (e.g., because the two datasets use different gene annotations), an error will be raised."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "参考矩阵要求行名为基因名，且表达值通常应为归一化并 log 转换后的值。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "@param ref A numeric matrix of expression values where rows are genes and columns are reference samples (individual cells or bulk samples).\n#' Each row should be named with the gene name.\n#' In general, the expression values are expected to be normalized and log-transformed, see Details."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的测试数据是 UMI counts、参考是 log-normalized expression，两者尺度不同；但来源提示原始 UMI counts 可不做归一化和 log 转换直接使用，因为相关性计算对单调变换不敏感。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "In practice, the raw counts (for UMI data) or the transcript counts (for read count data) can also be used without normalization and log-transformation.\n#' Any monotonic transformation will have no effect the calculation of the correlation values other than for some minor differences due to numerical precision."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的测试基因命名空间是 Ensembl stable IDs，参考是 HGNC symbols，且未提供映射表；这可能导致基因交集为空，因此不能直接开始。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:test_gene_namespace",
        "user:reference_gene_namespace",
        "user:mapping_table_provided"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "在开始前应先验证测试与参考基因标识能否映射到同一命名空间，并确认映射后存在非空基因交集。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "测试数据的 Ensembl stable IDs 与参考的 HGNC symbols 之间是否已有可用的基因映射表，或是否已确认两者存在非空基因交集？",
    "missing_field": "gene_intersection_or_mapping",
    "why_needed": "SingleR 要求 ref 与 test 有非空基因交集；当前命名空间不同且未提供映射表，无法判断是否会因交集为空而报错，因此需要先确认映射或交集情况。"
  }
}
